    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49280" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύελλ-α</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύω</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄελλα</span> from
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hurricane, squall</i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				395a6
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὴ ἀνέμοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.346
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισγομένων ἀνέμων . .
			θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.317
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός τ᾽ ὀλοοῖο
			θύελλαι</span>, prob.<i>thunderstorms</i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.68
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούρας ἀνέλοντο θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				20.66
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς δ᾽ αἶψ᾽ ἁρπάξασα φέρεν
				πόντονδε θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				10.48
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1151
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποντία θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>OC</u>
				1660
			</span></i>; in similes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογὶ ἶσοι ἠὲ θυέλλῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.39
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴκελοι πυρὶ ἠὲ θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				345
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτης θύελλαι</span>
			(nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυηλαί</span>, q. v.) <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				819
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχλικὴ θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.184S.
			</span></i></div>
